{'symbol': 'EW', 'date': '2022-09-12 09:05:00', 'title': 'EDWARDS LAUNCHES SAPIEN 3 ULTRA RESILIA VALVE FOLLOWING FDA APPROVAL', 'text': "IRVINE, CALIF. , SEPT. 12, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- EDWARDS LIFESCIENCES (NYSE: EW) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE LAUNCH OF THE SAPIEN 3 ULTRA RESILIA VALVE, WHICH INCORPORATES EDWARDS' BREAKTHROUGH RESILIA TISSUE TECHNOLOGY WITH THE INDUSTRY-LEADING SAPIEN 3 ULTRA TRANSCATHETER AORTIC HEART VALVE."}